---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Jarron Anthonipillai and his interests in compiler engineering and systems software.">
  <section class="max-w-3xl py-20">
    <p class="mb-3 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent">The person behind the code</p>
    <h1 class="text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight">About<span class="text-accent">.</span></h1>
    <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-base leading-8 text-muted">
      <p>I'm Jarron Anthonipillai, a Toronto-based software engineer with a background in mathematics and statistics from the University of Toronto.</p>
      <p>My current focus is compiler engineering and low-level systems programming. I'm particularly interested in parsers, code generation, LLVM, runtime systems, optimization, and the engineering trade-offs behind performant software.</p>
      <p>I learn best by building. Projects such as MicroCC, OptForge, ASCII Universe, Rusty8, and my LC-3 VM are opportunities to explore how these systems work from the inside.</p>
      <p>This site is a public engineering notebook: what I'm attempting, what I've learned, and what I'd change next time.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a href="https://github.com/JarronAnt" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="rounded-lg bg-accent px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-bg hover:brightness-110">GitHub ↗</a>
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jarronanthonipillai/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="rounded-lg border border-line px-5 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-ink hover:border-accent/60">LinkedIn ↗</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
